LICENSING NOTICE

This repository contains material with different ownership and license status.
There is no blanket license covering Spotify or all inherited packaging files.

1. Original contributions made by universish in 2026 are offered under the MIT
   license in licenses/MIT-new-contributions.txt, only to the extent universish
   holds the relevant rights. This does not relicense pre-existing code.
2. Inherited spotify-rpm-packager material remains owned by its original authors.
   No general license was located in the inspected upstream Git tree. Public
   availability or forkability does not establish permission for redistribution.
   Obtain the relevant permission before distributing a combined bootstrap.
3. licenses/LPF-bootstrap-LICENSE.txt is the reference LPF bootstrap license;
   it applies to the corresponding LPF material only. Its presence does not
   license unrelated files or Spotify. See COPYRIGHT for provenance.
4. Spotify application binaries, icons, branding and bundled resources remain
   governed by Spotify and third-party terms. They are excluded from the grant
   for packaging contributions. Preserve their original notices, including
   Apps/native-licenses.html. This project grants no Spotify redistribution right.

See eula.txt and docs/legal-distribution.md before any public binary/SRPM upload.
